        "original_id": "d14dc9a8-02cb-5311-b365-959c818679d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Donald Fagen, Lauren Laverne, Walter Becker\n- Organizations: Steely Dan, BBC Radio 6\n- Products: \"Show Biz Kids\", \"Anymore\", Silver Eye\n- Roles: musician, singer, keyboardist, radio DJ, model, television presenter, author, comedian\n\nFacts:\n- Donald Fagen was born on January 10, 1948, and he is an American musician.\n- Donald Fagen is best known as the co-founder, lead singer, and keyboardist of Steely Dan.\n- Lauren Laverne was born Lauren Cecilia Fisher, née Gofton, on 28 April 1978, and she is known professionally as Lauren Laverne.\n- Lauren Laverne is an English radio DJ, model, television presenter, author, singer, and comedian.\n- \"Show Biz Kids\" is a song composed by Walter Becker and Donald Fagen and performed by Steely Dan.\n- On 23 January 2017, the Silver Eye album's first single, \"Anymore\", was released to digital music retailers after premiering on Lauren Laverne's BBC Radio 6 show.",
